---
// Japan engraved map for Pachinko World Zone 5 (Osaka/Ikaino → Tokyo).
// Land paths traced from Natural Earth 1:50m — real geography, projected Mercator.
// Territory color-coding: all land graphite #49545F (Japan); ember #B0541A = Ikaino marker only.
// Macron note: Honshū rendered plain (no letter-spacing) to keep combining macron attached.
// Two progressive state reveals: osaka-marker, tokyo-marker.
// CSS in scrolly-zones.css controls visibility per data-state.
---

<svg
  viewBox="0 0 720 460"
  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
  preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet"
  class="sr-japan-map"
  role="img"
  aria-label="Engraved chart of Honshu showing Ikaino in Osaka and the later move to Tokyo"
